WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.660
School shooting in South Florida.

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.720
17 people shot to death.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.420
What can be done about school shootings?

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.480
Some say, kids will be safer

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.800
if some teachers carry guns.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.540
President Trump said that.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.800
We need to let people know, you come in to our schools

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.140
you're gonna be dead.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:20.300
Trump was mocked for suggesting teachers have guns.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.520
Arm a teacher is completely insane.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.650
It’s a terrible idea.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.540
A terrible idea.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.140
But Trump’s critics probably don’t even know

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:31.300
that many teachers have brought guns to school

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.740
for years.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.240
In Texas, teachers carry in about 200 schools.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.282
This high school advertises that.

00:00:38.282 --> 00:00:41.300
I can see that sign out on the highway,

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.780
Boy it’s great, man.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.000
Parents we interviewed here like the policy.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.360
It’s a good idea.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.320
I think we need it.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.750
It makes me feel safer.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.690
I love the Keene gun policy.

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:55.620
Superintendent Ricky Stephens created it, saying

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.760
if there’s trouble, teachers want

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.550
to go defend the kids.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:01.700
We know our staff and our teachers are gonna go.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.560
Do we want them to go with a pencil

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.860
or go with a pistol?

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.390
Everybody is against it.

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:09.040
This Florida student says teachers carrying guns

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.260
is a terrible idea.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:13.120
You are asking a teacher to

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:15.360
fight an assault rifle with a hand gun.

00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:16.650
That seems like a pretty

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:17.950
unfair fight to me.

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.325
The teachers have hand guns

00:01:20.325 --> 00:01:23.140
against somebody with a big gun.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.140
That's not much.

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:26.920
It's not much, but it's better than nothing.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.420
If you go there with nothing,

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.760
you have no chance of stopping anything.

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:33.580
The police come, they see your teacher with a gun.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.280
How do you keep them from shooting

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.000
her?

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.980
We train a lot with our local law enforcement,

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:40.880
so that helps us because we want them to at

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:44.180
least know we're there, and at least recognize us.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:45.860
If they happen to get shot

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:47.860
while they're stopping a tragedy,

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:49.490
all of our guardians have said,

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:52.320
"That's just the price of being a guardian."

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:55.220
His teachers saw how during Florida school shooting,

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:58.020
the security guard waited outside.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:00.740
It’s a reason she’s glad

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:02.840
she can carry her gun at school.

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:07.580
We hid her identity because she,

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:08.444
and the school,

00:02:08.444 --> 00:02:10.229
don’t want a potential attacker

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:12.110
to know which teachers are armed.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:13.560
Are you carrying now?

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:18.260
Many people say armed teachers created new dangers.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:21.580
Teacher accidentally fired a gun in his classroom.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:23.412
At this California school,

00:02:23.412 --> 00:02:26.300
a teacher mistakenly shot at the ceiling.

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:29.460
One student was slightly hurt by falling debris.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.780
But that’s the only incident we could find

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:34.260
where a student was injured.

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:35.080
On the other hand,

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:37.600
armed teachers have stopped school shootings.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.940
16-year old Luke Woodham has been arrested.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:42.120
When this student killed two classmates,

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.100
an assistant principal with a gun

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.660
held the killer at gunpoint until police arrived.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.780
We don’t know how often

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.920
armed teachers deter shootings.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.980
The media can’t cover crimes that never happened.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:57.780
The media also distort what President Trump proposed.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:58.974
Donald Trump said

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:00.780
teachers should have guns.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:04.300
Teachers should not be required to protect and serve

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.640
and to teach.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:06.650
Required?

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:08.860
No teacher is required to carry.

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:10.040
It’s voluntary.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:13.460
Those who want to bring their guns to school can.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.140
Here’s another distortion.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:18.760
I really do not support the idea of arming teachers.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.360
Arming Teachers.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:21.840
Arming teachers?

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.349
A new federal program?

00:03:23.349 --> 00:03:26.260
That’s not what the President proposed.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.500
Lots of teachers already have guns.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.700
All a school has to do is allow some to bring

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:32.540
their guns to school.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.600
At the Keene School District, however,

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:35.600
Superintendent Stephens

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.680
did create a new government program.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.100
The school purchases the gun,

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:41.780
and then we give them

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.680
and register them to our teachers.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.960
That way, he says, he can make sure all teachers

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:48.970
have training on the same type of gun.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.632
Finally, as we ponder the best way

00:03:51.632 --> 00:03:52.740
to keep students safe,

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:55.460
we should address the scariest myth.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.400
The epidemic of shootings…

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.600
Epidemic of school shootings…

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.380
Despite what the media say,

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:04.760
there is no epidemic of school shootings.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.960
No sharp increase.

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.600
School shootings kill far fewer kids than

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:13.739
driving, suicide, drowning, even suffocating.

00:04:13.739 --> 00:04:14.870
Why now?

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:18.209
School shootings are not in a big uptick.

00:04:18.209 --> 00:04:20.360
Exactly right, but we prepare for them because

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.860
if even one shooting happens

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:22.610
it's more than

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:23.360
we would want.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.300
You're 10 times as likely to die suffocating.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.199
Right.

00:04:27.199 --> 00:04:29.210
You can't protect against all these things.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:32.300
No, but we do train our kids in school

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:34.740
how to not suffocate and how not to drown.

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.780
Certainly Stephens’ armed teacher program

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.159
is cheaper than what my town does.

00:04:39.159 --> 00:04:41.800
New York City spends hundreds of millions of dollars

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.800
stationing police officers in and

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.600
around schools.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.454
Of course here, and in most blue states,

00:04:47.454 --> 00:04:48.858
suggesting that some teachers

00:04:48.858 --> 00:04:50.020
carry weapons

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.490
horrifies people.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.320
They don't understand

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:56.880
that a responsible trained teacher with a firearm

00:04:56.885 --> 00:04:58.259
is better than having

00:04:58.259 --> 00:05:01.210
a teacher with nothing.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:02.240
Texas will definitely probably

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:03.160
be leading the way

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:04.639
when it comes to protecting our kids

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.840
with weapons,

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:08.380
and that New York would choose to go

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.960
a radically different way.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.180
I’m glad that we live in a country

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:14.340
where the local people can decide

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.640
what goes on in their school district

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.180
and not a bunch of people in New York City.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.620
It’s good that America has 50 states.

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:24.020
That allows experiments.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.240
Teachers in New York City

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:26.460
may fear guns,

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:27.780
but teachers in Texas

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.080
can serve and protect.

